<title>YEMEN: YEMEN FOREIGN RESERVES $1.19BLN IN APRIL.</title>
<headline>YEMEN FOREIGN RESERVES $1.19BLN IN APRIL.</headline>
<dateline>SANAA 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Yemen Central Bank's foreign currency reserves rose to $1.19 billion in April from $1.10 billion a month earlier, bank figures showed.</p>
<p>The bank's foreign currency reserves stood at $1.5 billion at the start of 1997.</p>
</text>
